{"game": "risk-of-rain-2", "language": "english", "appid": 632360, "month": "2022-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1646697600, "end_date": 1647388799, "month_true_total": 6863, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-09-13 02:45:54 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "112262737", "author": {"steamid": "76561198139197708", "personaname": "arad", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198139197708/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 9040, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7362, "last_played": 1783482783, "avatar": "ed871fdb2df1ec21d08e354c047f1a1175205ae5"}, "language": "english", "review": "very good very nice\nvery good very nice\nhello sexy banana", "timestamp_created": 1647388107, "timestamp_updated": 1647388107, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 3, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "112262688", "author": {"steamid": "76561198125012911", "personaname": "Krybon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198125012911/", "num_games_owned": 246, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 43446, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7110, "last_played": 1772860096, "avatar": "2e4bd960dd8f1610c62b7f2a659cd0e9a64edcec"}, "language": "english", "review": "I got this game close to release, when there was a BOGO sale going on. A friend gifted it to me. Back then? It was an absolutely fine game. Good for some hours, and some good fun, but not a lot of content. I come to you now, 3 years later, to happily testify that after the 1.0 patch, and now this AMAZING DLC, Risk of Rain 2 is the best roguelike I've ever played, and it's still not done getting content.\n\nRoR 2 finds a beautiful balance between mind-numbing, \"big numbers go BRRRR\" game play and that stressful, high-stakes roguelike adrenaline that us masochists like. This game is HARD. I personally like to play Monsoon the most, and I am dipping my toes into the hardest challenges, Eclipse difficulty. But the beauty of Risk of Rain 2 is that you don't *have* to do that. Want to just have an arcadey monster killing, power fantasy party with your buddies? Turn on some alternate rules (Artifacts), go on an easier difficulty, and go to town. The game is a BLAST whether you are challenging yourself to git gud, or just taking a retina-destroying, explosive, flashy trip across Petrichor V, melting every enemy in sight with 30 procs on every action you take. \n\nCons? There ARE a few:\n- game EATS RAM for breakfast. once you get late game and there are 10 magma worms and 30 explosions a second, your processor is gonna be going to work. I'd say don't try this game without at LEAST 12 gigs, and really more like 16 if you want to do long runs. \n- multiplayer scaling is a little bad. It's perfectly fine on the easier difficulties, but if you play Monsoon or Eclipse with 3-4 people, the enemies will VASTLY outnumber and outscale you if you and your boys aren't absolutely CRACKED. \n- takes a LONG time to get all the unlocks, you'll often find yourself doing runs with the specific goal in mind of getting a really weird, niche unlock (10 crowbars? really, huntress?)\n\nBut really, that's all the cons I can think of. Seriously, just buy this game. It has something for you, whether you're a die-hard roguelike chad or a very casual player, Risk of Rain 2 has got what you're looking for.\n\nOh, and buy the DLC. It's the best DLC I have seen in a long time, in any genre, full stop.", "timestamp_created": 1647388030, "timestamp_updated": 1647388030, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "112262386", "author": {"steamid": "76561198963041074", "personaname": "lancer rpg #1 fan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fastsnail901/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 63003, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 92, "playtime_at_review": 8213, "last_played": 1788663323, "avatar": "c639d0a393a953d8f510f4625a6e994d587f1e9f"}, "language": "english", "review": "I think I'm starting to get the hang of it\n\nEdit: ~560 hours in and I think I'm starting to get the hang of it", "timestamp_created": 1647387489, "timestamp_updated": 1669266048, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525862038135528564", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "112262042", "author": {"steamid": "76561199051813552", "personaname": "RightLegOfSauron", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199051813552/", "num_games_owned": 147, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4326, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4177, "last_played": 1688413276, "avatar": "b2edbc430cffa963966ebafc9e7844414a9c51c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yesss", "timestamp_created": 1647386744, "timestamp_updated": 1656801350, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "112261519", "author": {"